## BotInfo
BotInfo-info = I am connected to { $channels } channels, with { $commands } commands, made by @{ $name } in Python (Twitchio). Bot website: { $url }
BotInfo-site = { $site_url }
BotInfo-uptime = I woke up { $time } ago.

BotInfo-deco_helper = Shows general bot statistics, uptime, and metadata like site and developer.
BotInfo-deco_usage = How to use: { $prefix }botinfo | { $prefix }site | { $prefix }uptime
BotInfo-deco_description = Displays information about the bot, such as number of channels, total commands, developer, uptime, and site.

# BotInfo Examples
BotInfo-cmd_ex1_res = I am connected to 10 channels, with 50 commands, made by @DevName in Python (Twitchio). Bot website: https://example.com
